{"updated":"2026-11-24T20:46+00:00","warnings":[{"event":"Flood Warning: River Hayle from Relubbus to St Erth","level":"amber","headline":"Flooding is expected: River Hayle from Relubbus to St Erth","description":"Rising river levels are expected to cause flooding overnight. \n\nFlooding is expected from the evening of Tuesday 24 November and into the morning of Wednesday 25 November. \n\nRainfall in the area will continue throughout tonight.\n\nProperties and low lying areas will start to flood from around 17:30pm on Tuesday. The main areas of concern are properties and low lying areas around the bottom of Tregembo Hill, Green Lane, Battery Hill Playground, Chapel Hill and Chenhalls Road. Flood waters may be deep and fast flowing in these areas. \n\nRiver levels are forecast to be at their highest overnight into Wednesday morning. \n\nWe are monitoring rainfall and river levels . \n\nTake care and avoid walking, cycling or driving through flood water.   \n\nThis message will be updated by 11:00AM on Wednesday 25 November or as the situation changes.","impacts":["Flooding is expected - act now"],"onset":"2026-11-24T17:22:39+00:00","expires":"2026-11-26T17:22:39+00:00","areas":[{"name":"River Hayle from Relubbus to St Erth","polygons":[[[50.169,-5.434],[50.17,-5.434],[50.17,-5.434],[50.171,-5.433],[50.171,-5.434],[50.171,-5.434],[50.171,-5.434],[50.171,-5.434],[50.171,-5.434],[50.172,-5.434],[50.172,-5.434],[50.172,-5.434],[50.172,-5.434],[50.172,-5.434],[50.172,-5.434],[50.172,-5.434],[50.172,-5.434],[50.172,-5.434],[50.172,-5.434],[50.172,-5.434],[50.172,-5.434],[50.172,-5.434],[50.172,-5.434],[50.173,-5.434],[50.173,-5.434],[50.173,-5.434],[50.173,-5.434],[50.173,-5.434],[50.173,-5.434],[50.173,-5.434],[50.173,-5.434],[50.173,-5.435],[50.173,-5.435],[50.173,-5.435],[50.173,-5.435],[50.173,-5.435],[50.173,-5.435],[50.173,-5.435],[50.173,-5.435],[50.173,-5.436],[50.174,-5.436],[50.174,-5.436],[50.174,-5.436],[50.174,-5.436],[50.174,-5.436],[50.174,-5.436],[50.174,-5